Quiz: Run Applications as Containers and Pods
1. Which command is executed in the ubi8/php-74:latest image?
Correct Answer:
✅ C — php-fpm -D, httpd -D FOREGROUND
Explanation:
This image runs:
•	PHP-FPM (PHP FastCGI process manager)
•	Apache HTTP Server
So the startup command runs both services.
________________________________________
2. UID behavior when deploying the container (Choose two)
Correct Answers:
✅ C — The container executes as a non-privileged user when deployed in a pod
✅ D — The container executes as the root privileged user when an OpenShift cluster administrator deploys it
Explanation:
•	OpenShift security model runs containers with random non-root UID by default.
•	Administrators can deploy containers with privileged/root permissions.
